        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Returns the tick labels and unit text for the visible major ticks in <emphasis>tickSet</emphasis>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Delegates to <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1TickLabelFormatter_1a3512cdcba04bad33cde1b19b39763836" kindref="member">doFormatTicks()</ref></computeroutput>. The result has exactly one label per tick value: missing labels are empty and extra ones are dropped. Called on the GUI thread, once per tick computation. The formatter may be shared by several axes, so anything decided for one tick set belongs in the result, not in the formatter. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
